  "description": "Story Sequencer — Xưởng kể chuyện. Shiplo Showcase #10: a graphic-novel storyboard desk where children 7-11 reorder shuffled story panels, connect cause to effect and pick the title that fits. Angular standalone app, static build.",
  "private": true,
